es\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"data-and-statistics\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 2 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 2 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 2 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Data হলো recorded observation; statistics data collection design, variation summarize এবং uncertainty-aware conclusion তৈরির method দেয়। এদের পার্থক্য ও সম্পর্ক শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Data are recorded observations; statistics provides methods for designing collection, summarizing variation, and drawing uncertainty-aware conclusions. Learn the difference and how they work together.\">Data are recorded observations; statistics provides methods for designing collection, summarizing variation, and drawing uncertainty-aware conclusions. Learn the difference and how they work together.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 40 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Data ও statistics আলাদাভাবে define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define data and statistics separately.\">Define data and statistics separately.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Descriptive ও inferential statistics আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish descriptive and inferential statistics.\">Distinguish descriptive and inferential statistics.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Raw value-কে analytical conclusion-এর সঙ্গে connect করুন।\" data-en=\"Connect raw values to an analytical conclusion.\">Connect raw values to an analytical conclusion.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Data quality statistical conclusion সীমিত করে—এটি বুঝুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize that data quality limits statistical conclusions.\">Recognize that data quality limits statistical conclusions.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data কী?\" data-en=\"What is data?\">What is data?</h2><p data-bn=\"Data হলো entity সম্পর্কে recorded fact, label, measurement, count, text, image বা event। Meaning, unit, context ও source জানা থাকলে value useful data হয়। শুধু “42” ambiguous; “Registration-এর সময় patient age 42 years” interpretable।\" data-en=\"Data are recorded facts, labels, measurements, counts, text, images, or events about entities. A value becomes useful data when its meaning, unit, context, and source are known. “42” alone is ambiguous; “42 years, patient age at registration” is interpretable.\">Data are recorded facts, labels, measurements, counts, text, images, or events about entities. A value becomes useful data when its meaning, unit, context, and source are known. “42” alone is ambiguous; “42 years, patient age at registration” is interpretable.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Statistics কী?\" data-en=\"What is statistics?\">What is statistics?</h2><p data-bn=\"Statistics হলো data থেকে শেখার discipline। এতে data collection plan, data describe, variation measure, unknown quantity estimate, claim test এবং uncertainty communicate করা অন্তর্ভুক্ত। Data-generating context ও interpretation বিবেচনা করলে calculation meaningful statistical work হয়।\" data-en=\"Statistics is the discipline of learning from data. It includes planning data collection, describing data, measuring variation, estimating unknown quantities, testing claims, and communicating uncertainty. A calculation is statistical only when the data-generating context and interpretation are considered.\">Statistics is the discipline of learning from data. It includes planning data collection, describing data, measuring variation, estimating unknown quantities, testing claims, and communicating uncertainty. A calculation is statistical only when the data-generating context and interpretation are considered.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Descriptive ও inferential statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive and inferential statistics\">Descriptive and inferential statistics</h2><p data-bn=\"Descriptive statistics observed data summarize করে: count, percentage, average, spread ও chart। Inferential statistics sample ব্যবহার করে wider population সম্পর্কে estimate বা test করে এবং sampling uncertainty বিবেচনা করে।\" data-en=\"Descriptive statistics summarize the observed data: counts, percentages, averages, spread, and charts. Inferential statistics use a sample to estimate or test something about a wider population, while accounting for sampling uncertainty.\">Descriptive statistics summarize the observed data: counts, percentages, averages, spread, and charts. Inferential statistics use a sample to estimate or test something about a wider population, while accounting for sampling uncertainty.</p><div class=\"inline-example\"><strong data-bn=\"উদাহরণ\" data-en=\"Example\">Example</strong><p data-bn=\"গত মাসের recorded sales dashboard descriptive। Survey sample থেকে সব customer-এর satisfaction estimate করা inferential।\" data-en=\"A dashboard showing last month’s recorded sales is descriptive. Estimating all customers’ satisfaction from a survey sample is inferential.\">A dashboard showing last month’s recorded sales is descriptive. Estimating all customers’ satisfaction from a survey sample is inferential.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data\" data-en=\"Data\">Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Meaning ও context-সহ recorded value বা observation।\" data-en=\"Recorded values or observations with meaning and context.\">Recorded values or observations with meaning and context.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Statistics\" data-en=\"Statistics\">Statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Data collect, summarize, analyze ও interpret করার method ও reasoning।\" data-en=\"Methods and reasoning for collecting, summarizing, analyzing, and interpreting data.\">Methods and reasoning for collecting, summarizing, analyzing, and interpreting data.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Descriptive statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive statistics\">Descriptive statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Observed data summarize করার method।\" data-en=\"Methods that summarize the data actually observed.\">Methods that summarize the data actually observed.</p><small class=\"term-example\" data-bn=\"৮০ employee-এর median salary।\" data-en=\"Median salary of 80 employees.\">Median salary of 80 employees.</small></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Inferential statistics\" data-en=\"Inferential statistics\">Inferential statistics</h3><p data-bn=\"Sample evidence ব্যবহার করে population সম্পর্কে reason করার method।\" data-en=\"Methods that use sample evidence to reason about a population.\">Methods that use sample evidence to reason about a population.</p><small class=\"term-example\" data-bn=\"Random sample থেকে voter support estimate।\" data-en=\"Estimate voter support from a random sample.\">Estimate voter support from a random sample.</small></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"সাত দিনের retail sales\" data-en=\"Seven days of retail sales\">Seven days of retail sales</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Daily sales BDT: 12,000; 15,500; 11,800; 18,000; 16,200; 13,400; 21,000।\" data-en=\"Daily sales in BDT: 12,000; 15,500; 11,800; 18,000; 16,200; 13,400; 21,000.\">Daily sales in BDT: 12,000; 15,500; 11,800; 18,000; 16,200; 13,400; 21,000.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"সাতটি number data value।\" data-en=\"The seven numbers are data values.\">The seven numbers are data values.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Unit BDT এবং entity হলো day।\" data-en=\"Their unit is BDT and the entity is a day.\">Their unit is BDT and the entity is a day.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Average, minimum, maximum ও chart descriptive summary।\" data-en=\"The average, minimum, maximum, and chart are descriptive summaries.\">The average, minimum, maximum, and chart are descriptive summaries.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"এই সাত দিন দিয়ে সব future day predict করতে assumption ও uncertainty প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Using these seven days to predict every future day requires assumptions and uncertainty.\">Using these seven days to predict every future day requires assumptions and uncertainty.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Observed average প্রায় BDT 15,414; এটি এই সাত দিন describe করে, guaranteed future daily sale নয়।\" data-en=\"The observed average is about BDT 15,414; it describes these seven days, not a guaranteed future daily sale.\">The observed average is about BDT 15,414; it describes these seven days, not a guaranteed future daily sale.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Data হলো context-সহ recorded observation।\" data-en=\"Data are recorded observations with context.\">Data are recorded observations with context.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Statistics হলো data থেকে শেখার discipline।\" data-en=\"Statistics is the discipline of learning from data.\">Statistics is the discipline of learning from data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Descriptive method observed data summarize করে।\" data-en=\"Descriptive methods summarize observed data.\">Descriptive methods summarize observed data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Inference uncertainty-সহ sample evidence extend করে।\" data-en=\"Inference extends sample evidence with uncertainty.\">Inference extends sample evidence with uncertainty.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Definitions of Statistics, Probability, and Key Terms ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}